	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/prism/materials/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="PRISM Rebaked and Path Traced draw each surface by the material the material pack or a mod gives it: its colour without the painted light, its bumps, roughness and metal. Off: every material made from the game's shaders."/>
		<string text="Lights armour and weapons with the materials mods give them: their colour, bumps, roughness, metal and coats, under any lighting. Stock draws them as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text="Gives weapons and armour the fine grain of their surfaces (machining, weave, wear) from a mod's material overlay, in Classic's light. It changes only the light on them. Off draws them as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text="Lights characters, weapons and vehicles by the surface maps a mod carries for its remodels, in Classic's light: their dents, seams and creases. Off draws them as the Xbox did."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Draws the sharper textures mods ship in place of the game's, once they are in the graphics card's memory. Stock draws the game's own."/>
		<string text="How much of the graphics card's memory mods' textures may take. Auto takes six tenths of what is free; past it, those not seen lately go back to the game's."/>
		<string text="How gently a sharper texture blends in as it arrives. Off sharpens it in steps."/>
		<string text="Waits up to this long a frame for a texture the game is still reading, rather than leaving its surface or character out until it arrives. Off as the Xbox."/>
	</strings>
